  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/circle-payments-network-reaches-41-3-billion-annualized-volume-in-q3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Circle Payments Network Reaches $41.3 Billion Annualized Volume in Q3</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/11/04/morgan-stanley-says-it-is-among-the-first-banks-to-put-u-s-stocks-and-treasuries-on-a-blockchain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Morgan Stanley says it is among the first banks to tokenize real world assets</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-11-03-cftc-approves-individual-stock-perpetual-futures-trading-in-us-for-first-time-432422\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFTC approves individual stock perpetual futures trading in US for the first time</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
